<section
    class="py-24 border-b-2 border-ink"
    aria-label="About the alliance"
>
    <div class="max-w-[1400px] mx-auto px-6">
        <div class="grid md:grid-cols-12 gap-12 items-start">
            <div class="md:col-span-5 reveal">
                <p class="label mb-4 text-coral">ABOUT</p>
                <h2 class="font-sans font-extrabold tracking-[-0.03em] text-5xl leading-[1.05]">
                    A working room, not a label.
                </h2>
            </div>
            <div class="md:col-span-7 md:pt-3 text-[17px] leading-relaxed space-y-5 reveal" style="transition-delay: 0.12s;">
                <p>
                    APA was started in 2019 by six producers who wanted a regular space to make
                    music together. It is now 142 members strong: hip-hop, footwork, ambient,
                    house, jazz, noise — anybody making sound in the city.
                </p>
                <p class="text-ink-soft">
                    We don't sign artists. We don't take a cut. We run the events, ship the
                    compilations, and split the merch profit back across the room.
                </p>
                <a class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 btn-text hover:text-coral transition-colors" href="/about">
                    Read the full story &rarr;
                </a>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>
